  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005, 0.65 accuracy) outperform singleprofile and PCA-based models. This experiment tests adding image data (resnet50) to the best RNA-only setup, using avgpool (proven effective in config_002/005) and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal integration while building on established effective components, balancing exploitation of known strengths with exploration of multimodal potential."
}

